    },
    {
      "text": "Pour milk into a large pot over medium-low heat; bring to a simmer. Add parsnips and salt. Cover and cook until parsnips are tender, 25 to 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YiWhowpd3EhS0JLlfvgj0F8rl3s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/239206-Mashed-Parsnips-ddmfs-step-3-025-b76c6a92dbd44a27a307f7c64101f6b2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/239206/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain parsnips, reserving warm milk in a separate container.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/znimR_HzcPMlE4mRqNV-11XJ2Bc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/239206-Mashed-Parsnips-ddmfs-step-4-036-e7e1efdea5e746f5a7b756b78bbb7563.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/239206/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mash together parsnips, 1 cup reserved warm milk, butter, thyme, and pepper in the same pot using a hand mixer or blender. Add more warm milk until desired consistency is reached. Season with salt and pepper.",
